{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["The sense of <b>ולא תשבעו בשמי לשקר</b> [you shall not swear falsely by My name]: after \"you shall not steal,\" because one suspected of theft or of a deposit will swear. And the sense of <b>תשבעו</b> [you shall swear]: to bring in the one who administers the oath." "The sense of <b>וחללת</b> [and you profane]: that one who swears falsely denies the Name, as I have explained."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:11.512404904Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}